Third-party code in src/port/riscv32
====================================

This folder is for 32-bit RISC-V: RV32I and RV32E cores, such as SHAKTI's
E-class and Espressif's ESP32-C3, C6 and H2. 64-bit cores, such as SHAKTI's
C-class, use src/port/riscv64.

The four files listed below come from newlib, copied byte for byte and never
edited. The other files in this folder (port_memcpy.S, port_memmove.S,
port_memset.S and port_memcmp.c) belong to libterae and are under libterae's
licence, given at the top of each of them.

All four files are SiFive's, and name their licence without its text, which
is therefore given at the end of this file.


